Thank you, <%= @invite_group.name %>!

We've saved your RSVP. Here's what we have on file — you can update it
anytime before August 10th.

<% @guests.each do |guest| -%>
<% status = guest.attending ? "Attending" : (guest.attending == false ? "Not attending" : "No response") -%>
- <%= guest.full_name %>: <%= status %>
<% if guest.attending -%>
<% attending_events = guest.event_responses.select(&:attending).map { |er| @events.find { |e| e.id == er.event_id }&.name }.compact -%>
<% if attending_events.any? -%>
    Events: <%= attending_events.join(", ") %>
<% end -%>
<% if guest.plus_one_guest.present? -%>
    Plus one: <%= guest.plus_one_guest.full_name %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

Update your RSVP: <%= form_invite_group_url(@invite_group) %>

We can't wait to celebrate with you.
— Ali & Brennan
